  "_comment": [
    "A synthetic Qualytics deployment for the golden-file test. Shaped to exercise",
    "every branch the connector has, because a golden file is only worth as much as",
    "the input behind it:",
    "  - all three store types (jdbc, dfs, native)",
    "  - a platform resolved by explicit map AND one resolved by inference",
    "  - a platform rename (postgresql -> postgres) and a native suffix strip",
    "  - table, view and file containers",
    "  - a passing check and a failing check with an anomaly",
    "  - a mapped rule type and one this build has never seen",
    "  - a container that has never been profiled",
    "Values are invented, not captured from any real deployment.",
    "Extended so the golden file exercises views, expression logic, range parameters and multiple anomalies -- see the note in test_golden.py."
  ],
